# Build context for docker/runner.Dockerfile and docker/hub.Dockerfile (`COPY . .`). The image needs
# only the sources, manifests and lockfiles: secrets, VCS state, local tooling and build output stay out
# of the layers. Secrets reach the containers at runtime (compose `environment:` / `env_file`, `-e`).

# secrets: operator .env (repo root or next to docker/compose.yaml) and any variant
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
**/id_rsa*

# VCS, run records, worktrees, local tool state
.git
.vanguard
.claude
.gstack
.idea
.vscode
**/worktrees

# deps and build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
dist
apps/desktop/dist
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target
coverage
*.log

# deployment artifacts that are not image inputs
docker/sbom.spdx.json
docker/target-repo
